{"last_link_id": 23, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [394.75872802734375, 435.5741882324219], "pos": [1499.013427734375, 328.8745422363281], "widgets_values": ["### **第一部分：创意内容描述 (Creative Content Brief)**\n\n| 标题 | 内容 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **项目名称** | 玩偶滑板冒险分镜 |\n| **分镜总格数** | 6格 (2x3) |\n| **总体风格** | 黑白、高对比度、手绘线稿 |\n\n**【分镜图内容列表 (Shot List)】**\n\n| 编号 | 画面描述 (Visual/Action) | 镜头/景别 (Shot Type) | 旁白/对话/文字 (Narration/Text) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 1 | 玩偶站在滑板上，脚踩滑板，表情自信，背景为城市街道。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | 无文字 |\n| 2 | 玩偶开始滑行，滑板轮子快速转动，背景模糊，突出速度感。 | 动态全景 (Wide Shot) | 无文字 |\n| 3 | 玩偶在滑板上跳起，完成一个简单的空翻动作，背景为滑板公园。 | 低角度特写 (Low Angle Close-up) | 无文字 |\n| 4 | 玩偶成功落地，滑板稳稳着地，地面扬起一些尘土，动作流畅。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | 无文字 |\n| 5 | 玩偶做出一个高难度滑板动作，滑板在空中旋转，背景为观众欢呼的场景。 | 高角度远景 (High Angle Long Shot) | 无文字 |\n| 6 | 玩偶停下滑板，对观众挥手致意，背景为滑板公园的出口，画面下方显示LOGO。 | 特写 (Close-up) | 无文字 |\n\n---\n\n### **第二部分：生成的黑白分镜图 (Generated Storyboard)**\n\n**【提示生成指令 (Prompt for Image Generation)】**：\n\"Generate a 6-panel storyboard in black and white ink sketch style, featuring a cute doll resembling the reference image playing with a skateboard. The storyboard should have clean and dynamic line art with a focus on action and movement. Each panel must visually depict the following:  \n\n1. The doll standing confidently on a skateboard, set against a city street background.  \n2. The doll starts skating, with the skateboard wheels spinning fast, creating a sense of motion.  \n3. The doll performs a simple jump and flip on the skateboard, with a skate park as the backdrop.  \n4. The doll lands smoothly, with the skateboard firmly on the ground, kicking up some dust.  \n5. The doll executes a high-difficulty trick, with the skateboard spinning mid-air, while a cheering crowd is visible in the background.  \n6. The doll stops and waves to the audience, standing at the exit of the skate park, with a logo displayed at the bottom of the frame.  \n\nEnsure the doll's design matches the reference image, including its fluffy hair buns, casual outfit, and sneakers. The overall layout should consist of 2 rows and 3 columns for a total of 6 panels.\""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 3, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "p0", "links": [16], "label": "p0", "type": "*", "localized_name": "p0"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [381.28167724609375, 688.863525390625], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "pwd"}, "name": "pwd", "label": "pwd", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "pwd"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "RHHiddenNodes", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHHiddenNodes", "info": "", "ref_info": "Z0FBQUFBQm85TjR1Ui1GbV9uWTdPM19sSTJtZFdwRlktM0ZxbU4zN2ZIU2pMQ21jdkRIcTdRdmdnUS05RmduRXhqWnJZS05qanl6X0tuWS1GQkp5MWEwS2hUTWd4MFJnUmc9PQ=="}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [5], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [281.0086975097656, 1153.798828125], "widgets_values": ["\"Create a 12-panel storyboard in black and white ink sketch style. Each panel should depict scenes featuring a Toyota Sienna car in various settings, maintaining high contrast and dynamic comic book line art style. Use pure black, white, and gray shading. Arrange the storyboard in a 3x4 grid format. \n\n1. Panel 1: Show a close-up of the front of the Toyota Sienna with a cityscape in the blurred background. Sunlight reflects off the car's logo.  \n2. Panel 2: Depict the Sienna driving through a bustling urban street, surrounded by tall buildings reflecting sunlight.  \n3. Panel 3: Show the car crossing a bridge with a river and the city skyline visible in the distance.  \n4. Panel 4: Illustrate the Sienna navigating a winding mountain road, surrounded by trees.  \n5. Panel 5: Close-up of the car's wheels driving through a muddy path, emphasizing its strong grip.  \n6. Panel 6: Sienna driving through a rainy scene, raindrops sliding off the windows, headlights glowing in the rain.  \n7. Panel 7: Interior view of the car with a happy family enjoying the ride, smiling and talking.  \n8. Panel 8: Show the open trunk of the Sienna, packed with various luggage, showcasing its spaciousness.  \n9. Panel 9: Illustrate the car driving through a desert landscape, kicking up dust behind it.  \n10. Panel 10: Sienna parked atop a mountain, surrounded by nature, with a beautiful sunset in the background.  \n11. Panel 11: Sienna driving through a vibrant city at night, neon lights reflecting off the car's exterior.  \n12. Panel 12: Close-up of the Toyota Sienna logo on a white background with the tagline 'Sienna, Drive Your Life' written below in bold.\""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 17, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [21], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [400, 240], "pos": [855.4595947265625, 1081.287353515625], "widgets_values": ["", 1530972075, "randomize", "16:9"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 4, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape